<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-03T01:42:30.386Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:42:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have intensified attacks across northern Nigeria, killing police officers in Borno, Plateau and Sokoto-Gusau, and abducting police, students, worshippers, mourners and schoolchildren in Zamfara, Benue, Kaduna and Niger. Armed groups also shot a tin miner in Barkin Ladi, killed two miners in a pit collapse, and robbed a convoy on the Kaduna-Zaria highway. Bandits ambushed a police convoy in Zamfara and killed five officers on the Sokoto-Gusau highway. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQONIBY0FVX3lxTE9zcHNaVXpldnJmQ1JvMDBLNEZOa2I2RGxQS0pVaHE1eGRpRmRFOExrajBRVTh4ZU4yc2pqZjVMUFpNY0JJRjFPMXRkbVNvUjZsU05vTUMxMHJzNWgwbXcwV2FQOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNNlhCNUJLOU0xMnhYR3VKTWxUZnJTMXNQdnF4cUJSZkE3YkY3b2pkOHk3WVEwTzducDdzQVdNakJ0Q1A3OVYxMThyQnJ6TlZ4WWpSSGpCT09CUmpOUHdQQU1yd0FBN3dMTDBCbk9tdUF2TnhzazN0MExrM0N4elFhZkE1eDJicUZGN0xFWTVwWllzakt4a2dQSA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOS3l0eVpQWnlVZTVucUhrR2ZjdTNyTEZ5X0hOODd6SURWc1JoOS12SVJCRHFMUHBrSzdyOXVCckltTEtxV09remx5cFp3SHJIcHViaFB1eHRyV3QzV05SaER6NGNSMDZxWXQ2Z1hRZmlWUlRla2prUFNZaHZlOENSWE1NUVdSeGdIOHNwWmw4d21YQUF1ZUE4bU5MRlJaMW9lZGpvNnBMZ0Q2dS0yX1BNNlROZk91Q1JtSjZrdF8yXzJvSmM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNc1VKeGJUWXVIOUgtNWhValE2Q2FlRjVqNjBxRHB4TUl3UzhHb2k5aEFIbGRCXzRkZm5HQmF3ZDJReW5KTDhmaFdDb3Ayell4SVdpVTM5YVBRTnNwMTNQSHduSVBnMk9lb1